EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

We have received your request to switch your major and the change has been completed. You can view this update on My ASU under My Programs and eAdvisor at https://my.asu.edu.

While you are in My ASU, please take a moment to review any additional items you may have to complete toward your enrollment at ASU.

If you have any questions, please contact me at {!User.Recruiter_Email__c}. I am your personal contact for admission-related questions, and I’ll be happy to help you through the admission process.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
